            <hcontainer name="item" eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1">
              <num>1</num>
              <heading>Paragraphs 5(3)(a) to (f)</heading>
              <content>
                <p>Repeal the paragraphs, substitute:</p>
              </content>
              <quotedStructure eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1" startQuote="“" endQuote="”" from="#" to="#">
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__para-a">
                  <num>a</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>for an electronic import declaration that relates to goods imported into Australia by air (other than goods imported through the post):</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__para-i">
                  <num>i</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>if the value of the goods is at least $10,000—$122.10 or such other amount (not exceeding $183.15) as is prescribed; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__para-ii">
                  <num>ii</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>otherwise—$40.20 or such other amount (not exceeding $45.00) as is prescribed; or</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__para-b">
                  <num>b</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>for a documentary import declaration that relates to goods imported into Australia by air (other than goods imported through the post):</p>
                  </content>
                </paragraph>
                <paragraph eId="schedule-1__amdact-1__item-1__qstr-1__para-i-2">
                  <num>i</num>
                  <content>
                    <p>if the value of the goods is at least $10,000—$122.10 or such other amount (not exceeding $183.15) as is prescribed; or</p>
